# NovaChat Dataset

A conversational dataset created for training and fine-tuning AI chatbots.

## Contents

- Human-written conversations
- Multiple conversation intents
- Natural user inputs and responses
- CSV format
- Easy to extend and customize

## Included Intents

- Greeting
- Goodbye
- Introduction
- Thanks
- Apology
- Yes
- No
- Small Talk
- Happy
- Sad
- Help
- Joke

## File Format

| text | intent | response |

Example:

text: Hello
intent: greeting
response: Hi! How can I help you today?

## Language

- English

## Current Statistics

- Conversation pairs: 171+
- Intents: 12
- File format: CSV